Season-blind; feet, yards, paces, strides, cords; no year count since the Kindling; nineteen; no possessive before "Path" in narration; no new proper names; Vastin without an age; the eleventh does not come; Shadow sealed; Oryn does not read Cael; Seln's case shut; consent explicit; every protected unit whole and once. Every chapter inside the three working ranges (sentence mean 13.3–14.2; ≥40-word share ≤4.5%; 850–1,050 words/scene); gates 0; overlap 0 unprotected.
