Author: `claude-opus-5-5` (Claude Opus 5.5), the same delegated session that drafted the movement, 2026-10-11. NO-SOURCE method: no file under `books/` or `v3-runs/` was opened; no git command was run. Baseline: `pre-repair-r1/` (the draft plus the coordinator's eleven applied fixes).

