editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/movement-001/EVENT-LIST.md:146:Five travellers. Eighteen, said once; nothing about nineteen. No fragment used; *Deployment since the Line: none* through day 49. The stillhound's sense unknown: Karis has the word only. Nobody hears "quiet ground". No healer, no Tide practitioner, no Oryn. No Compact on the page beyond Seln's one sentence and the registry's printed sheet. Teague and Cael exchange no words. The Thornwater carter is never named; nobody new is named, and no mule either. "The academy above Ostrand" in narration. Seln's case stays shut. No season, month or weekday names; no year count since the Kindling; no "his Path" for Cael.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/movement-002/recheck-r1.md:3:Apply the three line fixes listed below, then close Movement 2. No second author repair is warranted. The fixes are limited to one prohibited possessive before *Path*, one Book 5 overstatement in the bluff memory, and one surviving frame-shop reference. The manuscript itself was not modified during this recheck.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/state/movement-002/recheck-r1.md:60:The other coordinator constraints hold after the three listed fixes: deployment remains thirty; the technician's date is not printed as figures; the tall man has he/his pronouns; the text is season-blind; it gives no year count since the Kindling; nobody says *west* in the back room; Vastin has neither an age nor an Iron Wall; Seln teaches nobody; Oryn does not read Cael; and no new proper noun is introduced. Fix 1 is required before closure because chapter 7:171 still contains a possessive before *Path* in narration.
