editions/monroe-1.3/OWNER-DECISIONS.md-168-## 52–55. Book 8 — owner items from the early plan audit (coordinator defaults, 2026-10-11)
editions/monroe-1.3/OWNER-DECISIONS.md-169-Source: `book-08-before-the-paths/state/B7-RECONCILIATION-AUDIT.md` §F (Sol). The audit is early: Book 7's last two movements were still open, and it is re-run when they close. Defaults below hold until the owner rules; each protected line stays word for word.
editions/monroe-1.3/OWNER-DECISIONS.md:170:- **#52 (needed before Book 8 Movement 3).** Karis's protected "right for five years or wrong for five years". Book 7 never states her hypothesis and gives it no five-year history. **Default:** the line stays verbatim as Karis's own rounding; narration does not treat five years as a fact. Options: (1) the owner confirms an older private conviction, five years old, distinct from the Book 7 hypothesis; (2) release the clause for wording without a number; (3) the default.
editions/monroe-1.3/OWNER-DECISIONS.md-171-- **#53 (needed before Book 8 Movement 4).** Protected "it took four years and a hearing to walk out". The plan itself notes the figure does not fit the academy span; #18 bars numbers for time since Kindling, and Book 7's first pole was amended on that ground. **Default:** verbatim, as Cael's rough spoken figure, never repeated as fact. Options: (1) the default; (2) release only "four years" for wording without a number, as was done for Book 7's first pole; (3) settle the series calendar so that it is true.
editions/monroe-1.3/OWNER-DECISIONS.md-172-- **#54 (needed before Book 8 Movement 9).** The plan has the young member of Teague's crew named aloud once at his death. The edition has never named Teague's crew and no name is owner-approved. **Default:** no name is minted: the cry is narrated by its effect and the name's sound is not rendered. Options: (1) the owner supplies a name before Movement 9 (it then goes in the registry and the pronunciation list); (2) the default; (3) he stays unnamed even in-world.
editions/monroe-1.3/OWNER-DECISIONS.md-173-- **#55 (needed before Book 8 Movement 9).** "Tell Lira's family I said so" (Cael's last letter to Hesk) still has no setup; this is #25, still open. **Default:** verbatim, no setup added. Options: confirm the opaque line; authorize one earlier setup beat; release or remove the clause.
